  "sourceTitle": "Lychee Appetizer",
  "sourceText": "Lychee Appetizer\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Friday, February 12, 2010 - 6:40pm\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 can (20 oz) lychee, drained\n1 tablespoon Salted cashews, chopped\nounce Crabmeat, (canned or fresh, cooked)\n1 tablespoon Mayonnaise\n1 teaspoon Shoyu\n1 Green onion chopped\n2 teaspoons Lemon juice\nRed ginger, garnish\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Combine everything but lychee and ginger. Pack mixture into lychee. Top each lychee with red (good luck color) ginger . Chill well. Arrange on shredded lettuce and serve.",
